  "label": "Anti-Latino/Hispanic Stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Latinos are inherently desperate, criminal, or willing to risk everything to enter the U.S., particularly under a Trump administration. This stereotype is used to dehumanize and stigmatize Latinos based on their immigration status, portraying them as inherently dangerous or morally inferior. It is a form of xenophobic and racist rhetoric that has been historically used to justify discriminatory policies and attitudes.",
